flowchart TD
    START([用户消息进入]) --> AGENT[agent 节点\n理解意图、更新 DesignState]

    AGENT -->|显式发送图片| ANALYZE[analyze_reference_image\n分析参考图并合并 intent/note]
    ANALYZE --> AGENT_LLM[LLM 回复 + prompt_draft 更新]
    AGENT -->|无新图片| AGENT_LLM

    AGENT_LLM -->|ready_to_generate = false| END_COLLECT([本轮结束 · stop])

    AGENT_LLM -->|latest user 明确要求生成| ENHANCE[enhance_prompt 节点\n生成最终正向/负向提示词\n写 _enhanced_prompt]
    ENHANCE --> RAG_GATE[rag_gate 节点\n基于 EnhancedPrompt 生成检索文本\n调用 MCP search_by_text]

    RAG_GATE -->|RAG_BLOCKING_ENABLED=false\n或无候选| GENERATE["generate_image 节点\n1. 组装 control / annotated / reference / rag 图片槽位\n2. 提交 Celery 任务\n3. 轮询 Redis result backend\n4. 检查 cancel:{session_id}:{run_id}"]

    RAG_GATE -->|RAG_BLOCKING_ENABLED=true\n且有候选| RAG_POPUP[推送 rag_candidates SSE\n前端候选浮窗]
    RAG_POPUP -->|用户选中| RAG_PICK[下载候选图到 uploads\nVLM 生成 ambience_note\n写 AgentState.rag_image]
    RAG_POPUP -->|跳过或超时| GENERATE
    RAG_PICK --> GENERATE

    GENERATE -->|用户发来新消息\n旧 run 被置 cancel flag| INTERRUPTED[当前 run 中断]
    INTERRUPTED --> END_INTERRUPTED([本轮结束 · interrupted])

    GENERATE -->|任务失败或超时| GEN_ERROR[generation_error SSE\n标记任务失败]
    GEN_ERROR --> END_ERROR([本轮结束 · stop])

    GENERATE -->|生成成功| EVALUATE[evaluate_image 节点\nVLM 多维度打分]
    EVALUATE -->|fatal_issues 非空\n或 score < 0.72\n且 retry_count < 3| REFINE[refine_prompt 节点\n根据评估结果和上一轮图像修正提示词]
    REFINE --> GENERATE

    EVALUATE -->|score >= 0.72 且无 fatal_issues\n或 retry_count == 3| RETURN_RESULT[推送完整 generation_done\n保留 best_generation_result]
    RETURN_RESULT --> END_RESULT([本轮结束 · stop])

    FRONTEND[前端图片卡片\n操作按钮区] -->|用户点击「存入图库」| STORE_API["POST /api/library/store\n独立 REST 接口"]
    STORE_API --> MCP[store_generated_image · MCP\n存 PostgreSQL + Milvus]
